BT /F1 13 Tf 72 750 Td 15 TL (1. Detection and operating point) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 72 728 Td 12 TL
(The detector is the resnet18 model with weights resnet18.a1_in1k. Every frame is decoded to) Tj T*
(RGB and preprocessed with the model's timm data configuration \(resolve_data_config followed) Tj T*
(by create_transform with is_training=False\). No augmentation or test-time voting is used, so) Tj T*
(a frame has one deterministic top-1 class and softmax confidence.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The species register and the measured confidence bands are in detection_calibration.csv) Tj T*
(beside this note. The register maps six ImageNet top-1 indices to the field labels; only) Tj T*
(those classes are candidate detections. A frame outside the register contributes nothing.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(You must set the operating point from the calibration sheet, not from a familiar round) Tj T*
(number. Compute the midpoint of rejected_target_max_conf and accepted_target_min_conf, then) Tj T*
(round half up to the nearest 0.05. Count a candidate frame when its top-1 confidence is at) Tj T*
(least that operating point; the comparison is inclusive. The worked check at the end shows) Tj T*
(the arithmetic.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Blank and vegetation frames have no separate detector. Their observed top-1 confidences top) Tj T*
(out at blank_max_conf, below the operating point, so the same cut rejects them. Do not) Tj T*
(invent a blank class or a second threshold.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
endstream
