BT /F1 9 Tf 72 728 Td 12 TL
(If n = 0, report S = 0, H = 0, D = 0, and ChaoBC = 0. No estimator is evaluated on empty) Tj T*
(data. Otherwise S is at least 1 and the standard forms apply directly to the observed) Tj T*
(counts.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(H, D, and ChaoBC are rounded half up to four decimals. Counts n and S are integers and are) Tj T*
(never rounded. One row is written per roster site, keyed by site_id, with header) Tj T*
(site_id,n_det,S,H,D,chao.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The decision record has header choice,value,justification and exactly four rows:) Tj T*
(confidence_threshold, shannon, simpson, and chao. Its value column uses 0.70, natural_log,) Tj T*
(gini_simpson, and bias_corrected after the selection above.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
